{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55943","headline":"还丹口诀 · 戴偃","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"求仙觅黄芽，须得真铅花。\n并是自成者，乃可作所砂。\n重飞服一粒，腾空入碧霞。\n周游天地外，处处是仙家。\n（《大还丹照监》。\n原署「玄黄子」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}